MODULE: StickyFloorInfiniteSentinelIgnored
TARGET: StickyFloor
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the Infinite recovery sentinel loses its sticky Throttled floor
PERTURBS: Sample
BOUNDS: RecoveryWindow = 99

--- FIND
    /\ verdict' = [t \in Trees |-> [p \in Partitions |-> PartitionVerdict(t, p)]]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: accidentally treat Infinite as a disabled recovery window.
    /\ verdict' = [t \in Trees |-> [p \in Partitions |->
        IF RecoveryWindow = 99 THEN Raw(t, p) ELSE PartitionVerdict(t, p)]]
--- END
--- FIND
    /\ treeVerdict' = [t \in Trees |-> TreeValue(t)]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: Infinite loses its tree-wide floor as well.
    /\ treeVerdict' = [t \in Trees |->
        IF RecoveryWindow = 99 THEN RawTree(t) ELSE TreeValue(t)]
--- END
